            "review_title": "Review at One More Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "ChoosyFox\nSlough, United Kingdom103 contributions\n0\nCraft beer place with no beer\nMay 2023 • Couples\nStopped here for a taste of local craft beer. Were shown a very diverse menu only to find out that the 'signature' beer isn't available. Going further down the list (and up in price) were told that our other selections weren't available either. We asked why and were told that \"many people wanted them\". We left. If you don't have half your beers available at 8pm on a Friday what chance do you have as a beer house?\nRead more\nWritten May 5, 2023",
